11
01:01:06,666 --> 01:01:12,666
Coyote Ugly is a 2000 American comedy-drama film
based on the Coyote Ugly Saloon.

12
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
It was directed by David McNally, produced by Jerry Bruckheimer and Chad Oman, and written by Gina Wendkos and
an uncredited Kevin Smith, based on "The Muse of the Coyote Ugly Saloon" by Elizabeth Gilbert.

13
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
Set at the titular drinking establishment in New York City, the film stars Piper Perabo in her
breakthrough role, Adam Garcia, Maria Bello, Melanie Lynskey, and John Goodman.

14
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
The film received mostly negative reviews but was a box office
success nonetheless, grossing $113 million worldwide.

15
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
The film has become a cult classic over the years.

16
01:28:53,333 --> 01:28:59,333
In 2020, Tyra Banks said that she had been lobbying the
original production team for a sequel for years.

17
01:34:26,666 --> 01:34:32,666
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
